      "message": "Not your bug, but I think Precedence::kAssignment can cause an issue if N is `a + b` because the addition will have higher precedence than the addition. Then, because the unary minus has higher precedence than addition for you\u0027ll get:\n`select(-a + b, . . .)` instead of `select(-(a + b), . . .)`",
